<title>INDIA: RBI data on industry-wise foreign investments.</title>
<headline>RBI data on industry-wise foreign investments.</headline>
<text>
<p>Foreign Direct Investment Inflows</p>
<p>			     (Industry-wise)</p>
<p>							  (US $ Million)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>			   1995-96   1994-95   1993-94   1992-93</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Finance		    270.0	 97.7	42.2	 3.7</p>
<p>Engineering		251.9	131.6	32.9	69.8</p>
<p>Electronics &amp;</p>
<p>Electrical Equipments  129.6	 56.4	57.1	32.8</p>
<p>Chemicals &amp; Allied</p>
<p>Products		   126.7	141.2	37.5	47.0</p>
<p>Services		   100.5	 93.4	20.2	 2.4</p>
<p>Food &amp; Dairy Products   85.0	 60.9	43.5	27.9</p>
<p>Pharmaceuticals	   54.8	 10.1	49.5	 3.1</p>
<p>Computers		   52.1	 10.2	 7.6	 8.3</p>
<p>Domestic Appliances	0.5	108.3	 2.4	15.8</p>
<p>Others		     346.9	162.2	76.1	69.1</p>
<p>Total		    1,418.0	872.0     369.0     280.0</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Source : Reserve Bank of India annual report for 1995/96</p>
<p>(July-June).</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
